---
description: Privacy and cost boundaries for storage, telemetry and vendor APIs
globs: "services/**,crates/sovir-privacy/**,crates/sovir-adapters/**,infra/**"
alwaysApply: false
---
Never log captures/messages/PII. Default external inference disabled and budget zero in local environment. Use server-side hard budgets, source-scoped consent, retention TTL and encryption for persisted private data. Verify provider mode/terms before enabling. Cost/energy effects documented in PR.
